window.products.push({"id":1040047,"name":"100CC Food Grade Oxygen Absorbers (10 Pack in Individual Vacuum Bag, Total 60 Packs) Oxygen Absorbers for Long Term Food Storage with Oxygen Indicator","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hJzYryEhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ 【Preminum Food Grade Oxygen Absorbers】: Our factory have 18 years experience in oxygen absorber, Also we have ISO9001 Certificate, All our oxygen absorbers are preminum food grade material and tested under strict food regulation, Very safe to be used with foods and pharmaceuticals storage. ✅ 【Extend Shelf Life】: Oxygen absorbers bring about oxidizing enzymes that cause browning and malodor, Oxygen-absorbing packaging reduces the amount of oxygen in food storage containers, With our oxygen absorbers these phenomenon will not happen aslo can extending product freshness and shelf life. ✅【 Packaging】: Our oxygen absorbers are 10 pack in an individual vacuum bag to minimise the waste, Come with an oxygen indicator to let you know whether it is good for when you received it, if the color is pink means it is ok to use ✅ 【Anti-Oil Film Design】: Our oxygen absorbers are double layer and anti-oil film design that can use for oil food storage oxygen absorb, You can place them with oil and oil-free food storage to extend the shelf life of these foods. ✅ 【Widely Use in Daily Life】Oxygen absorbers widely used in daily life food storage, such as homemade jerky, nuts, spices, candy, medicines, pet food, etc, It can help maintains the original taste, flavor, color, and nutritive value of food to keep food fresh for a long time","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hJzYryEhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LIFJOY","source_asin":"B09YGKSQ1V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1040047","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YGKSQ1V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YGKSQ1V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1040048,"name":"Find-Its Combo Art Bails Variety Jewelry, Antique Copper","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81btc+dqq3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Turn any of your creations or \"finds\" into jewelry, key chains, baubles, zipper pulls, cell phone accessories, and much more. Each package of Combo Art Variety Pack, CB-01, includes 5 antique copper plated bails (1 Moroccan, 1 Studded, 1 Heart, 1 Thatch, and 1 Fluted) with textured glue tabs. Moroccan Bail overall length with glue tab is 31.5mm, the bail length w/o glue tab is 16.6mm, the inner bail length is 12.7mm, and the width is 11mm. Heart Bail overall length with glue tab is 28.2mm, the bail length w/o glue tab is 13.1mm, the inner bail length is 8.4mm, and the width is 11.5mm. Thatch Bail overall length with glue tab is 28mm, the bail length w/o glue tab is 12.8mm, the inner bail length is 10.5mm, and the width is 6mm. Studded Bail overall length with glue tab is 26mm, the bail length w/o glue tab is 12.2mm, the inner bail length is 10mm, and the width is 8mm. Fluted Bail overall length with glue tab is 27mm, the bail length w/o glue tab is 12.2mm, the inner bail length is 10mm, and the width is 8mm. They are a zinc alloy base (Nickel Free) plated with copper and then given a patina for an antique finish. Use a small amount jeweler's glue to adhere your bail to any glass art, stones, polymer clay, paper art, found objects, ceramic, or any other creation that needs a loop attached for hanging. Gently sanding the bail and the objects surface, where the bail will adhere, will provide the best results. Small parts; not for children.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81btc+dqq3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Find-Its","source_asin":"B008TO5AMM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1040048","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008TO5AMM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008TO5AMM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
