window.products.push({"id":1040051,"name":"Tovolo Scrape and Scoop Green Silicone Multi-Purpose Scraper","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CZ6IecftL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Alice bread, spread butter, scrape jars, scoop jam, and more with this Tovolo Scrape and Scoop multi-purpose scraper. Made from flexible and durable silicone, this utensil is gray on one side and green on the other. The wavy design in the middle of the handle makes it as attractive as it is handy, and the over-sized handle flexes for easy access to hard to reach places. The gray end is flat, which is ideal for spreading, slicing, and flipping, and the green end is curved upward, which is ideal for scooping and scraping. 10-5/8\" L x 1-1/2\" W x 3/4\" H","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CZ6IecftL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tovolo","source_asin":"B008MNLOSE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1040051","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008MNLOSE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008MNLOSE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
