window.products.push({"id":1040059,"name":"Proscenic Cordless , 120AW 60mins Runtime Stick Vacuum Cleaner with Smart App, Lightweight Vacuum Cleaner Carpet and Floor Pet Hair 2200mAh Detachable","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":199.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vdTE4gilL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【60Mins Runtime Detachable Battery】8 x 2200mAh large capacity battery provide up to 60mins of running time (ECO mode) for the wireless vacuum cleaner. The removable battery makes it easy to rechargeable separately. If you buy an additional battery (ASIN: B09MTJ364G), the runtime will be doubled. 【30000Pa Powerful Suction】450W Super powerful motor & 3 adjustable suction power levels, up to 30KPa (Max mode), and high-efficiently to remove pet hair and food. This lightweight vacuum is ideal for elderly and women to use on hard floors or carpets, and it can also be used in your car 【Smart App Display & Smart service】 The Smart cordless vacuum cleaner can be synced with the Proscenic app via bluetooth to track your cleaning reports, check for faults, There's also troubleshooting assistance and online customer service to assist you in resolving issues quicker. 【Touch Screen & LED Display】Large touch screen LED control panel makes it effortless to adjust the vacuum power and know the status of your vacuum cleaner. It is more intuitive to show the battery capacity, suction performance, fault alert that provide you with more efficient, faster and more intelligent dust collection services 【Can be Used with Pet Power Brushes】The stick vacuum cleaner the use of a pet brush set (Sold SEPARATELY, ASIN: B09NDFXW25), which allows you to use several brush heads for pet hair care. Not only to comb, clip and remove pet hair, but also to absorb dust from its hair surface, while also collecting hair into the vacuum cleaner in time to keep your home clean and avoid scattering hair around the house 【4 Stages Filtration & Multiple Brush Heads 】The vacuum cleaners with a multi-stage filtration system that captures 99.99% of the particles ejected during cleaning and seals in tiny particles without leaking, and come with multiple brush heads (dust, pet cats, debris, etc.) can be switched freely to meet your various cleaning needs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vdTE4gilL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Proscenic","source_asin":"B09J51CTJP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1040059","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09J51CTJP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09J51CTJP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
