window.products.push({"id":1040063,"name":"Berndes Round Casserole Dish with Lid, 20cm, 2.4 Litre, Cast Iron, Light Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718RWQWwdFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Take a step back from modern spec-heavy cookware and enjoy the classic, reliable and versatile functionality that this Berndes Casserole Dish has to offer. Made from cast iron with an enamel coating, this dish retains heat much more effectively than other cookware and even features natural non-stick properties without using potentially harmful synthetic coatings. Strong and extremely durable, this superb dish is designed to last a lifetime - perfect for any home. Set Contains: 1 x Berndes 1504101 Round Casserole Dish with Lid, 20cm, 2.4 Litre, Cast Iron, Light Green","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718RWQWwdFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Berndes","source_asin":"B00OEX0BQC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1040063","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00OEX0BQC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00OEX0BQC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1040064,"name":"New York Ornament Wooden Souvenir Christmas Tree Decoration with City of New York Gift","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71asjaTEcuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Beautiful high-quality laser cut Christmas ornament of New York, New York! These ornaments make the perfect gift and are 4 x 4 inches. FAQs: What ribbon comes tied to my ornament? We take the time to hand tie ribbons to each one of our ornaments. We use the highest quality grosgrain ribbon so even after years of use, your ribbon will not fade or fray. The color that is displayed in the product photo is the color that will come in your order. How thick is the wood? Our wood is 1/8 inches thick which we have found is the optimal thickness to provide stability while also being lightweight. Where should I display my ornament after the holiday season? While we have heard countless places our customers display their Joseph's Workshop ornaments in the off-season, the three most common are: displaying on a shelf, using a small nail or push pin to showcase it on a cubicle or next to a desk, and even hanging in the car rear-view mirror. If you come up with a new spot, be sure to send us a picture via social media or email! Can I order custom ornaments with my own logo or design? Absolutely! If you would like custom items made, please email us at: zac@josephworkshop.com What is Joseph's Workshop Return Policy? We love our customers and take pride in every piece we create. If you are not 100% satisfied, contact us and we will work with you to ensure your experience with us is positive.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71asjaTEcuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Joseph's Workshop","source_asin":"B0BGYR2HR6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1040064","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGYR2HR6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGYR2HR6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
