window.products.push({"id":1040156,"name":"Celadon covered coffee / tea mugs - goldfish design, set of 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31VV142AXXL._AC_.jpg","description":"Celadon refers to the pale green glaze of the ancient Chinese stoneware. Celadon originated in China, where porcelains and ceramics were first invented, but it is produced throughout Asia. Each country has its own unique shade, due to slight differences in the clays and materials used to create the distinguishing green color. While ancient porcelains found in China are unglazed, celadon is perhaps the earliest example of glazed porcelain in the world. It was first used for cups and bowls in very utilitarian manner, but soon lent itself to decoration. The double carp design embossed on our celadon dinnerware is a derivation of one of the first known decorative patterns on Chinese porcelain ware. The carp is a symbol of prosperity in China. As porcelain once exemplified both high technology and affluence, it is not surprising that the carp should adorn it. As celadon is technically stoneware, a dense clay ceramic, it is durable as well as dishwasher and microwave safe. Reorient has a full line of Celadon dinnerware that is sourced in northern China from some of the oldest operating factories that still produce Celadon as it was a hundred years ago, hand worked with wood and coal fired kilns. The character and quality of each item is consistent with 19th century craftsmanship and will lend the mystique of old world Asia to your dinner setting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31VV142AXXL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Reorient","source_asin":"B000CER2JG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1040156","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000CER2JG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000CER2JG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1040157,"name":"MadeTerra Bamboo Rustic Fan Wall Decor | Wall Hanging Boho Woven Home Decor Wall Pediment | Beautiful Wall Art for Apartment, Room, Home Decoration (E","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Y+RzhJWZL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"Looking for a unique rustic farmhouse wall decor? MADE TERRA wall hanging fan is not just another woven wall art pediment, it is the symbol of wealth, good luck and protection. The purpose of fan, is to guide and redirect energy to the desired space. In oriental fengshui, it’s a symbol of wealth, good luck and protection. Beautiful fan tail motifs and decorative fans are traditional wall pediment in Asian homes. Decorate your home with this special wall fan for a unique rustic farmhouse chic look. This wall art creates a sense of oriental harmony and comfort for your home.This wall fan special gift for any one who loves rustic farmhouse decor or the oriental wall art. As the symbol of wealth, good luck and protection, this is great anniversary gift, birthday, and Christmas,Thanksgiving, New Year, Valentine's Day gift. They make a chic decoration for weddings, bridal shower, and any occasion YOUR PURCHASE MAKES AN IMPACT Made Terra is a local maker-to-market company by artisans in Vietnam. Made Terra is a local maker-to-market company by artisans in Vietnam. Our wall hanging art fans are masterfully hand woven by skilled artisans in Kim Son region – the base of sedge and seagrass craftsmanship of Vietnam for the past 200 years - nestled 110 kilometers outside of Hanoi capital city By purchasing our rustic wall fan decor, you help: Thriving Artisan Communities Preserving Indigenous Crafts & Cultures Promoting Greater Equity in World Trade Add some specials to your home while helping artisan villages in Vietnam with the Extra Large Rustic Fan Wall Decor | Wall Hanging Boho Woven Home Decor Wall Pediment | Beautiful Wall Art for Apartment, Room, Home Decoration! Click to add it to your cart NOW!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Y+RzhJWZL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MadeTerra","source_asin":"B084P4872C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1040157","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084P4872C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084P4872C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
