window.products.push({"id":1040237,"name":"Chic Home Alecto 3 Piece Reversible Quilt Set Contemporary Watercolor Floral Theme Design Bedding-Decorative Pillow Sham Included, Twin, Multi Color","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fZcEaCjSS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Create a flower garden oasis in your bedroom with the unique look of the Alecto quilt set from Chic Home. This reversible quilt features a watercolor floral theme in a palette of subdued blues and purples on the face with a geometric white on purple pattern on the reverse. Complete the contemporary floral theme with the included deco pillow and design coordinated floral sham or mix and match with your own pieces for a distinct look. Specifications: • Size: Twin • Color Scheme: Multi-color • Piece Count: 3 • Set Includes: • 1pc Reversible Quilt (66” x 90”) • 1pc Floral Pillow Sham (20” x 26” + 2”) • 1pc Pinch Pleat Decorative Pillow (12” x 18”) • Materials: Luxuriously brushed microfiber fabric, hypoallergenic synthetic down alternative filling Fabric and Design: • Silky soft brushed microfiber cotton-feel material • Watercolor floral theme with a geometric white on purple pattern on the reverse Features: • Luxuriously soft feel for a great night sleep with less tossing and turning • Hypoallergenic alternative down filling is perfect for those allergic to traditional down materials • Just the right fill to keep you comfortable when the weather gets warmer • Built to last with premium fabrics and expert stitching Care Instructions Dry clean preferred. Machine washable, use front loader machine (or top loader without agitator) to avoid tearing, use cold water on gentle cycle, tumble dry low Add 2 tennis balls to the dryer to speed up drying and add fluffiness The digital images we display have the most accurate color possible. However, due to differences in computer monitors, we cannot be responsible for variations in color between the actual product and your screen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fZcEaCjSS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chic Home","source_asin":"B085Z1CWMM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1040237","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085Z1CWMM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085Z1CWMM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
