window.products.push({"id":1040570,"name":"De Buyer Mineral B Element Iron Crepe Pan Bundle with De Buyer Beechwood Spatula (10.2 Inch Pan)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41IHJtLDrcL._AC_.jpg","description":"Bundle - 2 items. De buyer mineral b element iron crepe pan, 10. 2 inches diameter (26 cm), model no. 5615. 26, and de buyer beechwood spatula, 13. 75 inches long, model no. 4809. 36. These crepe pans have a low skirt and heat evenly, making it ideal for cooking french crepes. They have a riveted handle with an ergonomic grip. The iron will blacken with use, resulting in a non-stick finish. The spatula has beveled edges and is made entirely out of beechwood - perfect for turning crepes, pancakes, blinis, tortillas, and more without damaging your pans. Care for pan: not dishwasher safe, not detergent safe. Instead, deglaze, rinse with warm water, dry, and lightly oil. Made in france.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41IHJtLDrcL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"De Buyer","source_asin":"B01HQHFNTW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1040570","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01HQHFNTW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01HQHFNTW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1040571,"name":"Ivation IVADM45 Powerful Mid-Size Thermo-Electric Intelligent Dehumidifier w/Auto Humidistat - For Small Spaces of Up to 100 Square Feet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71os0tLEGXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This isn't a watered-down version of a bigger dehumidifier Ã¢â¬â it's a highly effective mid-size machine in its own right, built around the powerful and whisper-quiet Peltier technology. Peltier technology works with no moving parts, so we managed to design our dehumidifier as a compact appliance: small, lightweight, low on energy consumption, powerful, effective at drying up musty rooms, and, with all that, a long lifespan.Â Suited for spaces up to 2,200 cubic feet, our mid-size dehumidifier is the perfect tool to extract moisture and dust particles from stagnant areas and mildew- and mold-stricken rooms. From bathrooms to laundry rooms to bedrooms to antique cars to boats, it rids the air of mustiness and unpleasant odors while quietly pulling in excess humidity at a rate of up to 25 ounces per day at 86ÃÂ° Fahrenheit and 80% relative humidity.Â Another advanced function is the auto humidistat. Dehumidifiers without a humidistat work hard non-stop even if RH levels drop as low as 20%. This wastes energy and wears out the power adapters. With the humidistat function, you can set your desired relative humidity level in the range of 40%-80%. When RH levels increase beyond your set level by a value of 5%, the machine automatically turns on. When RH levels decrease below your set level by a value of 5%, the machine automatically turns off. Default setting is 50% RH.Â A removable water reservoir with a capacity of two full liters spares you the hustle of emptying out an overflowing water tank every day. It can hold approximately 2.5-days' worth of dehumidifying action. It is also programmed to shut off automatically once it has reached capacity. An indicator light will go on to remind you to empty the tank out.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71os0tLEGXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ivation","source_asin":"B00KO0S0U8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1040571","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KO0S0U8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KO0S0U8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1040572,"name":"PYY Electric Chafing Dish Full Size Stainless Steel Chafer,Temperature Control, Chafing Dish Buffet Set for Catering,Buffets","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":199.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71J43-Sz9yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Adjustable Temperature Control-PYY chafing dish for buffet has a numerical control panel with a temperature display so that we can read and adjust the temperature easily. Great for keeping food at perfect serving temperatures.NOTE:Not Heating, Just Keep Warming! Keep Warming More Evenly and long time -This chafing dish buffet set with a built-in electric hot plate, low power consumption for efficient and high-powered heating. It can warm up food by hot water efficiently ,thus keeping more heat inside and preserving the freshness of the food,and maintain longer than traditional alcohol-heated chafing dishes. Clear Chafing Dish Cover-A wide, clear roll top chafing dish lid allows guests to easily see the contents of the chafer without opening it, simple and convenient. Plus, the lid is quickly detachable for convenient cleaning This clear chafer lid of PYY chafing dish buffet set is PVC structure with high light transmittance for complete visibility of colorful dishes and desserts. Food grade material eliminates health worries. Sleek and Sturdy-PYY buffet severs and warmers are made of high quality stainless steel which is ideal for a buffet warmer.Easy to operate and the chafing dishes are heavy duty and durable, Serving your food presentation and be prepared for a variety of special occasions,such as catering, parties, restaurant, buffet, hotel, holiday gathering, wedding brunch, picnics. Electric Chafing Dish -Keep food at the perfect servable temperature for long periods of time with PYY Electric Chafing Dish. The catering set for the buffet includes 1X 10qt Food Pan(2.6\"Deep), 1X 16qt Water Pan. You can serve your guests with confidence knowing they'll enjoy hot, fresh food thanks to this PYY Electric buffet warmer. If there are any problems with this electric chafing dish set, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71J43-Sz9yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PYY","source_asin":"B0C2KMCNG1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1040572","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2KMCNG1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2KMCNG1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
