window.products.push({"id":1040641,"name":"Northlight 15.5\" Red and Black Buffalo Plaid Pet Embroidered Christmas Stocking","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71akdLH0QCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Celebrate your fur buddy this season with this super fun Christmas stocking. Perfect for a cat or dog with a white embroidered paw print over a buffalo plaid base, shaped just like a paw print. Treat your pets to some awesome stocking stuffers this Christmas. Product Features:. Paw print Christmas stocking. Features black and red buffalo plaid base. There is a white embroidered paw print. One-sided design, there is a red fleece backing. This stocking has a white faux fur cuff. Stocking comes ready-to-hang on a red loop. Recommended for indoor use only Dimensions: 15.5\"H x 8.25\"W. Material(s): polyester","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71akdLH0QCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Northlight","source_asin":"B081QX1QY2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1040641","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081QX1QY2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081QX1QY2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1040642,"name":"OTOTO Vino Spooky Bat Wine Opener - 2-in-1 Wine & Beer Opener, Corkscrew & Bottle Opener - Wine Accessories & Gifts for Wine Lovers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OdDkE5QaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Meet Vino, the bat - From the Design Awarded Studio OTOTO, we bring you Vino, the Bat! Grab the wine and don't hold back; Vino keeps your night on track! Vino makes the perfect gifts for wine lovers! Opens corks easily without pain; treat yourself to a glass of wine or two, for this bat is here as your trusty corkscrew. Add him to your collection of cute kitchen tools and gadgets and you're all set! Spook'-tacular gift for anyone - Looking for fun kitchen gadgets or housewarming gifts? Vino's durable wings and sharp fang open corks in a swift! This funny novelty item is also ideal if you're in search of new home gift ideas. A corkscrew opener made with functional design, Vino is built to pop open your bottles, whether beer or wine. Easy open as one two three, pour up your fizzy drinks and toast with glee. Take your drinks to the 'neck's' level - Drinking sessions are more fun with this cork screwer that's ready to stun! Make beer cocktails like Beer Margarita and Black Velvet. How about wine mixes like Sangria, Mimosa, or Apple Snaps Fizz? Vino flaps its wings and lands on the bottlecap. He twists and turns until you hear the cap snap! He pierces through the foil and cuts with no mess. Vino does the magic for when you need to impress! Fang'-tastic cork opener - It's a wine bottle opener that's extra special, for it's made from high quality silicone and metal. Enjoy your blood-red wine with a handy corkscrew to open it up. Watch Vino sink its fang on the cork and make it pop up! No toxins and chemicals that are harmful for you- it's BPA-free and doesn't rust too! A 'spook'-tastic staple that's right for the night. Let Vino, the Bat set your sesh alight! A sprinkle of fun - Ever heard of the one where they lived happily ever after? Well, that's always the story with OTOTO's household products, because everyday chores are no longer a bore when you've got adorable gadgets to explore! Our team strives to create functional products with a quirky and unexpected twist. We love sprinkling in a bit of fun and magic in all that we do and we hope you feel the same way too!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OdDkE5QaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OTOTO","source_asin":"B0C5XRF32P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1040642","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5XRF32P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5XRF32P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
