window.products.push({"id":1040677,"name":"FRESHMINT Luxury Cooling Flat Sheet King Size, Comfort Breathable Soft & Silky Quick Dry, Wrinkle Resistant Machine Washable, Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qOOwrnoQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Do you crawl into bed at summer night? If so, you are not alone Thankfully you can overcome this never-ending cycle.  Get a good night’s sleep with FRESHMINT extraordinary cooling technology flat sheet ✔COLD SENSE TECHNOLOGY ✔COOLING FIBER, LASTING COLD FEELING ✔HIGH VALUE Q-MAX / COLD REAL SENSE ✔Q-MAX VALUE IS UP TO 0.45, EFFECTIVE COOLING LIKE A SMALL AIR CONDITIONER  (*The Q-MAX value is the maximum value of skin heat loss when simulating human contact fabric.)  Nano-grade jade powder added to natural resin additives, stretch to 8D density and weave the yarn into a cold fabric, greatly enhanced the thermal and moisture conductivity of the fabric.  At the same room temperature, normal duvet cover is close to 71.96℉, while the cooling duvet cover is only 60℉ Reduces body surface temperature by 1-2 degrees at the moment of touch.  Quickly absorb the heat generated by the body and keep it dry for a long time.  This cooling duvet cover regulates temperature, disperses heat and promotes airflow keeping you pleasantly comfortable all night Warm tips:  In summer, the cold sense is stronger in the air-conditioned room. It is recommended to increase the air-conditioning temperature by 2-3 degrees to avoid catching a cold.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qOOwrnoQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FRESHMINT","source_asin":"B07QTK85MP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1040677","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QTK85MP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QTK85MP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
