window.products.push({"id":1040710,"name":"Ruby-Skay Woven Wall Basket Decor - Set of 2 Hanging Decorative Baskets Handmade Natural Seagrass Boho for Bedroom, Dining, Living Room, Lounge, Study","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/918X5YV67JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"At Ruby-Skay, our motto is Quality with Distinction, as we thrive to offer only premium home décor accessories created with traditional craftsmanship techniques and carefully selected materials that will pass the test of time. We rely solely on new home décor trends and the mastery of our artisans in order to create stunning décor accents that will fill your home with freshness, finesse, and warmth. If you are not 100% pleased with your purchase, we are always at your disposal for any issues or concerns. Woven Basket Décor – Transform Your Home into an Elegant, Modern Environment This wall hanging basket décor is handcrafted by Vietnamese artisans using 100% natural seagrass and traditional manufacturing techniques to offer you a unique wicker basket décor to enrich your home like no other. The baskets have a natural color and a minimalist, rustic touch that will create a superb décor centerpiece in your living room, bedroom, office, or nursery. Our decorative trays come ready to hang anywhere you like, so you can bring a balanced, neutral tone and a fresh touch to any modern, boho, rustic, farmhouse room décor. Some of the amazing features of this product: Set of 2 hanging woven wall décor baskets; Dimensions: 11.8 x 1.57-inch; 100% natural seagrass; Handmade in Vietnam; materials; Ready to hang; Wicker basket with black design pattern; Durable and resistant; Rustic boho style; Ideal for home, office, bedroom, living room, hall, entryway, nursery; Thoughtful housewarming present; Note: Do not submerge in water due to the natural material. Elevate your room décor with our woven basket set!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/918X5YV67JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ruby-Skay","source_asin":"B09F74YHN9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1040710","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09F74YHN9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09F74YHN9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
