window.products.push({"id":1040964,"name":"Pasta Attachment for KitchenAid Stand Mixers With Cleaning Brush,Pasta Maker Attachment for Kitchenaid 3-Piece Set Including Pasta Sheet Roller, Fettu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":103.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Fh9JnPnlS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[ALL Stainless Steel Design] This Pasta Attachment is designed for ALL Kitchenaid stand mixers. Made of Stainless Steel ,which is sturdy and durable, far superior to plastic shell models. Give you the perfect experience of pasta. Package includes pasta sheet roller, fettuccine cutter, spaghetti cutter, cleaning brush and user manual. 【Professional 3-Piece Set】Pasta roller is designed to roll 5.5-inch sheets of dough with 8 thickness settings, using to make ravioli, tortellini, dumplings, empanada, etc. Easy to pull the knob straight outwards and turn it accordingly, then free your hand. The fettuccine cutter can cut pasta sheets into hearty fettuccine noodles, linguine and lasagna. If you like spaghetti, the spaghetti cutter will be help. Every tool is alone, it will not make the dough stick to the cutter when rolling. 【Ideal Tools for Pasta Making】These pasta roller & cutter attachments for kitchenaid mixer are necessary kitchen gadgets for people who loves handmade a variety of pasta at home. To get smooth and pliable dough, we recommend to adjust the 8 thickness settings from 8 to 1 gradually, repeat folding and kneading process several times. 【Healthy and Easy Clean】By using the food grade material of pasta attachments, people will be able to enjoy delicious pasta quickly at any time. Warm tip: Not Dishwasher Safe! We recommend you to clean the 3-piece set pasta maker accessories with brush or soft cloth by hand. The cleaning brush that come with it helps us easily remove bits of flour and pasta. It would just take you a few minutes. 【Excellent Family Gift】The pasta maker attachments for household kitchenaid mixer help save time and free your hand. It is a perfect gift for your family and friends to enjoy life together on weekends, holidays or parties. We provide 3-Year Warranty","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Fh9JnPnlS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kitchood","source_asin":"B08D6SGV2G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1040964","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08D6SGV2G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08D6SGV2G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
